Searching for stage platform rental in Malaga, Spain, usually means a speaker, a host or a panel that has to be seen from the back of the room. A stage platform, also called a stage riser or a deck, is a raised floor that does that. This page explains the modular platforms we actually own, which package lets you add them, how they are priced and what we source when you need something different.

Malaga Event Gear (MEG) owns modular stage platforms and delivers them across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol, together with the sound system for the event. They are one part of our [audiovisual equipment rental service](/blog/audiovisual-equipment-rental-service/), where you can see the rest of the range.

