## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear owns modular stage platforms, listed in our equipment inventory as Guil modules of 2x1. The [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) lists modular stage platforms as an optional extra at 35 euros per square meter, sized to your room rather than sold as a fixed unit. We publish no count, height or load rating for them. More platforms than we own, or a different kind of stage, means suppliers.

