## Our Modular Stage Platforms

Our stage platforms are modular: Guil modules of 2x1, sized to your room rather than sold as one fixed unit. That is why the MICE Pack extra is priced by the square meter and not by the unit. They suit conferences, presentations, award ceremonies and corporate events where a speaker or a panel has to be seen.

![A stage area with flight cases in front of a lighting structure, in an outdoor arena with palm trees at night, at the Bmotion event in Marbella where we supplied platforms and staging structures.](https://cdn.malagaeventgear.com/blog/3079/2026.05.19-20-Bmotion-Marbella-4-1536x864.webp "Platforms and staging structures were part of what we supplied for the Bmotion event in Marbella on 19 and 20 May 2026.")

We do not publish a technical sheet for them. No count, height, load rating, material, steps, handrails or ramps, and no claim about an anti slip surface or adjustable legs. If one of those matters for your event, tell us and we say plainly what we can and cannot offer.

